":"Seul 1988 - Romania","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"Taken on 17 September 1988","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.cosr.ro/sportiv/daniel-dumitrescu/galerie-foto\">https://www.cosr.ro/sportiv/daniel-dumitrescu/galerie-foto</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"Unknown (Comitetul Olimpic si Sportiv Roman)","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table class=\"licensetpl\" style=\"display:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"licensetpl_short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl_link_req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl_attr_req\">false</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; clear: both; margin: 0.5em auto; background-color: var(--background-color-progressive-subtle, #f7f8ff); color: var(--color-base, #202122); border: var(--border-subtle, 2px solid #8888aa); border-spacing: 8px; padding: 0px;\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"layouttemplate\" lang=\"en\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Public domain\"><img alt=\"Public domain\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/120px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/PD-icon.svg/250px-PD-icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"196\" data-file-height=\"196\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>According to the Romanian <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://legislatie.just.ro/Public/FormaPrintabila/00000G3NZ1CUZDTA5IC0XZSXBLX8UX6R\">Decree no. 321/1956 of June 18, <b>1956</b></a> Chapter 1 Article 7</i>, non-artistic photographs were not expressly protected by copyright. Artistic photographs taken between 1956 and 1996 are protected by copyright for a limited term, as follows:\n<ul><li><i>(b) 10 years since issuance for the author of an artistic photographic series</i></li>\n<li><i>(c) 5 years since issuance for the author of an isolated artistic photograph</i></li></ul>\n<p>Of the aforementioned photographs, those whose term hadn't expired before 1996 received a considerable prolongation, according to the <i>Romanian Law on Copyright and Neighboring Rights <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.legi-internet.ro/lg8_1996.htm\">Law no. 8/1996 of March 14, <b>1996</b></a> Article 149, Paragraph 3</i>, modified by <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cdep.ro/proiecte/2003/400/30/6/leg_pl436_03.pdf\">Law no. 285/2004 of June 23, <b>2004</b></a>, Article 128</i>:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>The length of copyright over works that have been <b>created before</b> the enforcement of this law and whose <b>protection terms had not expired</b> according to the previous legislation are prolonged to the protection term provided by this law.</i></dd></dl>\n<p>Therefore, Romanian artistic photographs whose protection term expired before 1996 are now in the public domain. These include <b>photographic series published before 1986</b> and <b>isolated photographs published before 1991</b>. As a courtesy, please credit the author whenever using the photograph.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:small;line-height:1.4\" class=\"plainlinks noprint\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-RO-photo/de\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-RO-photo/de\"><bdi class=\"language lang-de\" lang=\"de\">Deutsch</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-RO-photo/en\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:PD-RO-photo/en\"><bdi class=\"language lang-en\" lang=\"en\">English</bdi></a> <b>∙</b> <small class=\"plainlinks\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Template:PD-RO-photo/lang&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=Template:PD-RO-photo/lang&amp;action=edit\">+/−</a></small></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Coat_of_arms_of_Romania_%281952%E2%80%931965%29.svg/120px-Coat_of_arms_of_Romania_%281952%E2%80%931965%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Coat_of_arms_of_Romania_%281952%E2%80%931965%29.svg/250px-Coat_of_arms_of_Romania_%281952%E2%80%931965%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"900\" data-file-height=\"980\"></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]}]}}